    {
      "source": "The returned <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> is active and may be modified. Note,\nhowever, that the interceptors will not be resorted according to their\n<a href=\"../../../core/annotation/AnnotationAwareOrderComparator.html#sort(java.util.List)\">order</a> before the\n<a href=\"../ClientHttpRequestFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequestFactory</code></a> is built.",
      "translation": "返回的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> 是活跃的，可能会被修改。请注意，在构建 <a href=\"../ClientHttpRequestFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>ClientHttpRequestFactory</code></a> 之前，拦截器不会根据其 <a href=\"../../../core/annotation/AnnotationAwareOrderComparator.html#sort(java.util.List)\">order</a> 进行重新排序。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> This method does not support concurrent changes,\nand in most cases should not be called after initialization on startup.\nSee also related note on <a href=\"../../../web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>\nregarding concurrent configuration changes.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong>此方法不支持并发更改，在大多数情况下，不应在启动初始化后调用。另请参阅有关并发配置更改的<a href=\"../../../web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>相关说明。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Not intended to be used directly.\nSee <a href=\"../../../web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a> for an entry point.",
      "translation": "不打算直接使用。请参阅<a href=\"../../../web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a>作为入口点。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The interceptors will get immediately sorted according to their\n<a href=\"../../../core/annotation/AnnotationAwareOrderComparator.html#sort(java.util.List)\">order</a>.",
      "translation": "拦截器将立即根据其 <a href=\"../../../core/annotation/AnnotationAwareOrderComparator.html#sort(java.util.List)\">顺序</a> 进行排序。",
      "count": 2
    },
