      "source": "The default is a <a href=\"../SimpleClientHttpRequestFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>SimpleClientHttpRequestFactory</code></a> based on the JDK's own\nHTTP libraries (<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/HttpURLConnection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.net\"><code>HttpURLConnection</code></a>).",
